---
import BaseLayout from '@kedoupi/shared/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import ProductList from '../../components/ProductList.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="我的应用"
  description="围绕生活记录、资本决策与内容表达的私域智能应用集群。把数据留给自己，把智能带给生活。"
  pathname="/apps/"
  schemaType="WebPage"
>
  <div class="apps-page">
    <header class="apps-header">
      <span class="apps-eyebrow">01 / 私域应用生态</span>
      <h1 class="apps-title">从生活出发的<br /><em>专属应用集群。</em></h1>
      <p class="apps-lead">
        把数据留给自己，把智能带给生活。每一个系统，都专注于记录一段真实人生；它们各自独立，又在统一的私域智能中彼此呼应。
      </p>
      <div class="apps-tags" aria-label="系统特征">
        <span class="apps-tag">5 个生活维度</span>
        <span class="apps-tag">私域数据主权</span>
        <span class="apps-tag">SSO 统一鉴权</span>
        <span class="apps-tag">向未知生长</span>
      </div>
    </header>

    <section id="applications" class="app-directory" aria-label="应用入口">
      <ProductList detailed />
    </section>

    <section class="apps-growth" aria-labelledby="growth-title">
      <div class="apps-growth-inner">
        <span class="apps-growth-label">向未知生长 · 持续进化</span>
        <h2 id="growth-title" class="apps-growth-title">不给生活设限，更多系统正在路上</h2>
        <p class="apps-growth-desc">
          当前的五个系统，是我此刻专注推进的生活切片。未来无论出现新的健康设备、新的投资研究维度还是新的写作媒介，都会以同样克制、自主的方式接入进来。
        </p>
        <div class="apps-growth-actions">
          <a class="kdp-button" href="/desk/">进入我的工作台 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
          <a class="kdp-button kdp-button--secondary" href="/about/">了解空间理念</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .apps-page {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 48px;
  }
  .apps-header {
    max-width: 760px;
  }
  .apps-eyebrow {
    display: inline-block;
    color: var(--brand-orange-interactive);
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }
  .apps-title {
    margin: 0 0 20px;
    font-size: clamp(34px, 4.4vw, 50px);
    line-height: 1.16;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }
  .apps-title em {
    font-style: normal;
    color: var(--brand-orange);
  }
  .apps-lead {
    margin: 0 0 24px;
    font-size: clamp(16px, 1.8vw, 19px);
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }
  .apps-tags {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 10px;
  }
  .apps-tag {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 6px 14px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--color-text);
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(45, 42, 40, 0.02);
  }
  .app-directory {
    margin-top: 8px;
  }
  .apps-growth {
    margin-top: 16px;
    padding: 44px 40px;
    border-radius: 24px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-surface) 0%, rgba(255, 230, 217, 0.25) 100%);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(45, 42, 40, 0.03);
  }
  .apps-growth-inner {
    max-width: 680px;
  }
  .apps-growth-label {
    display: inline-block;
    color: var(--brand-orange-interactive);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .apps-growth-title {
    margin: 0 0 14px;
    font-size: clamp(22px, 2.5vw, 28px);
    font-weight: 650;
    line-height: 1.3;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }
  .apps-growth-desc {
    margin: 0 0 28px;
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }
  .apps-growth-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 14px;
    align-items: center;
  }
  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .apps-page {
      gap: 36px;
    }
    .apps-growth {
      padding: 30px 22px;
      border-radius: 20px;
    }
    .apps-growth-actions {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: stretch;
    }
    .apps-growth-actions .kdp-button {
      width: 100%;
    }
  }
</style>
